gpui-base 0.8.1
Upstream: https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit
License: Apache-2.0; the upstream LICENSE-APACHE is distributed with gpui-base.

Newport modifies gpui-base for key event constructors for GPUI's added key
fields, and exact text selection copies with fractional line heights. The
changed files are src/button.rs, src/checkbox.rs, src/dialog.rs,
src/input/base/element.rs, src/input/base/state.rs, src/link.rs, src/radio.rs,
src/root.rs, src/selectable_text.rs, src/switch.rs, src/text_selection.rs and
src/toggle.rs. All other published package files remain unchanged.
